# TICKET API ================================================================

### Listar todos os tickets
GET /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


### Buscar ticket por id
GET /api/v1/tickets/1 HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


### Criar ticket válido
POST /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
    "acao": "Aprovar",
    "objeto": "Proposta comercial",
    "detalhes": "Proposta enviada pelo cliente em 10/07.",
    "criador": "julie@gmail.com",
    "destinatario": "leda@gmail.com",
    "observadores": [
        "batata@gmail.com"
    ]
}


### Criar ticket simples
POST /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
    "acao": "Revisar",
    "objeto": "Contrato de serviço",
    "criador": "julie@gmail.com"
}


### Colocar ticket em andamento
PATCH /api/v1/tickets/1/status HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "ANDAMENTO",
    "responsavel": "leda@gmail.com"
}


### Resolver ticket
PATCH /api/v1/tickets/1/status HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "RESOLVIDO"
}


### Cancelar ticket
PATCH /api/v1/tickets/1/status HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

{
    "status": "CANCELADO",
    "motivo": "Cliente desistiu."
}


# LOGOUT ================================================================

### Logout
POST /auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}


### Testar token após logout
GET /api/v1/tickets HTTP/1.1
Host: {{host}}
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}